SUMMARY:Sweetwater/Coastal Sage Camporee
DESCRIPTION:Sweetwater/Coastal Sage Camporee\nWestern Winds\nCost\nCamp Fe
 es:\n$25.00 per Scout & AOL registration\n$15.00 per parent/registered ad
 ult\n$40 Scout plus ranges Limited to 64 spots\nPlease note:\nPARTS A & B
  of the BSA ANNUAL HEALTH & MEDICAL FORM are REQUIRED to attend event.\nT
 he Shooting Sports Form is also required for all youth participating in s
 hooting sports.\nTroops will be responsible for providing and cooking the
 ir own meals.\nFor More Information:\nPaul Koniarski -\npkoniars@gmail.co
 m\nJackie Ficarra -\nJacqueline.Ficarra@scouting.org\n‍\nVisit our 2026
