DTSTAMP:20261018T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261018
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261019
SUMMARY:Honor Guard Training
DESCRIPTION:Honor Guard Training\nHONOR — SERVICE — COMMITMENT\nThis t
 raining will cover history and etiquette\, indoor and outdoor flag ceremo
 nies\, flag retirement and more.\nTraining is open to all registered Scou
 ts and Adults.\n1-5pm\, Snacks provided\, Cost is $10 a person.\nContact\
 n: Alex Bedoya\,\nkhanito@aol.com\n\nhttps://www.sdicscouting.org/events/
 honor-guard-training-october
URL:https://www.sdicscouting.org/events/honor-guard-training-october
LOCATION:Camp Balboa\, San Diego-Imperial Council\, Scouting America\, 120
 7 Upas St\, San Diego\, CA 92103\, USA
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
