DTSTAMP:20261019T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261019
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261020
SUMMARY:Eagle Project Counselor Training
DESCRIPTION:Eagle Project Counselor Training\nAdvancement Training\nWould 
 you like to become an Eagle Scout Service Project Counselor OR renew your
  training?\n‍\nThis is an opportunity to hear all of the latest informa
 tion that you need to know in order to effectively work with prospective 
 Eagle Scouts.\n‍\nIt is also helpful if you wish to serve on an Eagle S
 cout Board of Review.\nEmail RSVP to: doris.mccarthy@sdsu.edu\n\nhttps://
 www.sdicscouting.org/events/eagleprojectcounselor-training
