BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:eagle-camp-week-1@sdicscouting.org
DTSTAMP:20270320T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270320
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270321
SUMMARY:Eagle Camp
DESCRIPTION:Eagle Camp\nSave the Date\nEagle Camp will be an opportunity u
 nlike any other!  Rather than a traditional class or group model\, Eagle
  Camp will be a resource opportunity for young Scouts who are serious ab
 out making significant strides towards achieving Eagle Scout to work inde
 pendently or in teams to complete requirements.\nThe Scout’s week will 
 include opportunities for fun\, team building\, and recreation\, but most
  important to the Eagle’s advancement goals\, the camp will provide the
  necessary materials for a Scout to complete the following merit badges a
 nd a staff of counselors to assist the Scouts in their quest.\nCamping\nC
 itizenship in the Community\nCitizenship in the Nation\nCitizenship in So
 ciety\nCitizenship in the World\nCommunications\nCooking ($45 additional 
 fee)\nEmergency Preparedness\nEnvironmental Science\nFamily Life\nFirst A
 id\nPersonal Fitness\nPersonal Management\nSustainability\nScouts may com
 plete as many or as few of the offered badges as they choose. This is a s
 elf-paced program that will require the Scouts to exhibit a level of inte
 rnal motivation expected of an Eagle Scout Candidate. Mere camp attendanc
 e does not assure the completion of any badges.\nA Scout must be age 14 o
 r have completed 8th grade in advance of the camp session's start date to
  participate.\nSPACE LIMITED EACH SESSION\n\nhttps://www.sdicscouting.or
 g/events/eagle-camp-week-1
URL:https://www.sdicscouting.org/events/eagle-camp-week-1
LOCATION:Camp Balboa\, 1207 Upas Street\, San Diego\, CA 92103
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:trailblazer-camp-week-1@sdicscouting.org
DTSTAMP:20270320T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270320
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270321
SUMMARY:Trailblazer Camp
DESCRIPTION:Trailblazer Camp\nSave the Date\nA special one-week Scouts BSA
  Day Camp opportunity for new Scouts BSA at Camp Balboa. This program foc
 uses on the requirements on theTrail to First Class and will include Toti
 n' chip\, Firem'n Chit as well as the opportunity to earn Merit Badges.\n
 This camp is ONLY for NEW Scouts BSA who have not achieved the rank of Fi
 rst Class.\nEvery activity planned for the week is meant to give theScout
  a great introduction to the Scouts BSA Camping Program and also a head s
 tart towards advancement. A record of all Rank achievements earned will b
 e sent home after the close of camp for the Scout to give to the Scout Le
 ader to record.\nSPACE LIMITED TO ONLY 40 SCOUTS\n\nhttps://www.sdicscout
 ing.org/events/trailblazer-camp-week-1
URL:https://www.sdicscouting.org/events/trailblazer-camp-week-1
LOCATION:Camp Balboa\, 1207 Upas Street\, San Diego\, CA 92103
END:VEVENT
